title: "arsc: fast, validated single-cell compute"
abstract: "Memory-mapped single-cell stores and Python reimplementations of Seurat, scanpy, harmony, presto, UCell, DESeq2/limma-voom/fgsea and clonal (TCR) methods, each checked numerically against its reference software."
